  "provenance": {
    "source_notes": "Reference for this template's layout, text, and colors came from a clean, isolated plate texture the Forza Writer user supplied -- one of a set of thirteen originally extracted from GTA V's companion iFruit app (not this app's own game files, and not a screenshot taken in-game) and posted publicly to Reddit by u/sgtfrankieboy. A brand tie-in novelty plate for Patriot, GTA's fictional beer brand. The real design centers on an elaborate badge -- crossed pistols over a star, a 'BEER'/'PATRIOT'/'SINCE 1985' ribbon banner, and a 'DRINK US' rubber-stamp graphic in the corner -- none of which this schema can represent (no icon/emblem/stamp primitive); only the wordmark text and the background/stripe colors are modeled, same simplification as every other branded plate in this set. Background reads as a white-to-blue vertical gradient in the reference; simplified to a single flat pale-blue color here (no gradient primitive). A red/white/blue horizontal stripe runs near the bottom, colors approximated by eye against the reference rather than sampled precisely (the stripe is thin and partly obscured by the 'DRINK US' stamp in the source image).",
